BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dominate Parkinson's with David Williams
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260427T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260427T170000
UID:1c17c4136a7b36436390a5b5286f52db@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an inspiring evening as local triathlete David Wil
 liams shares his journey of resilience\, determination\, and purpose. Afte
 r being diagnosed with Parkinson’s Disease in 2025\, David made the deci
 sion not to slow down but rather to push forward. It’s a big year for Da
 vid. He’s turning 60 and taking on multiple triathlons\, including train
 ing for the Augusta Ironman 70.3\, all while raising awareness and support
  for the Parkinson’s Foundation as a Parkinson’s Champions athlete. At
  this event\, David will share his story\, the challenges he’s faced\, a
 nd what it means to keep moving forward in the face of a life-changing dia
 gnosis. This event is hosted by Sterling Ideas IT\, a managed IT services 
 company and Apex Chamber member\, as part of our Q2 community service init
 iative\, supporting causes that make a meaningful impact in our local comm
 unities. ?? April 27 ? 6:00–8:00 PM ?? Gather Station\, New Hill If you
 ’re able to attend\, we’d love to have you there. Register Here You ca
 n also l
LOCATION:Apex\, NC
URL:https://business.apexchamber.com/events/details/dominate-parkinson-s-w
 ith-david-williams
X-SOURCE:Apex Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
